1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,265
The kettle SCREAMED! Why did the kettle scream?!

2
00:00:02,365 --> 00:00:06,638
Ssssilence! Who dares to tiptoe into MY pantry?

3
00:00:06,737 --> 00:00:09,931
Everyone freeze. Don't move. Don't even breathe.

4
00:00:10,031 --> 00:00:17,065
Midnight is coming. Mr. Pot has Crispy. And the Golden Crumb led the Dough Bros into the pantry.

5
00:00:17,165 --> 00:00:22,109
The key is pulling us behind that kettle. There's a little door back there!

6
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:27,388
A secret tunnel. My calculations say it goes straight to Mr. Pot's oven.

7
00:00:27,488 --> 00:00:32,910
Mr. Pot told me. Nobody passes. Nobody makes a SOUND. I hate noise!

8
00:00:33,010 --> 00:00:36,377
He hates noise? I'm made of noise! I'm basically one big scream!

9
00:00:36,477 --> 00:00:41,634
Okay team, here's the plan. We get past him quietly. Very quietly.

10
00:00:41,734 --> 00:00:47,445
Better plan! Behold, the Sticky-Trap 3000! Pure honey. It catches anything!

11
00:00:47,545 --> 00:00:50,836
Zeek, sweetie, are you sure it catches kettles?

12
00:00:50,936 --> 00:00:55,346
Absolutely. Eighty percent. Okay, it caught a raisin once.

13
00:00:55,446 --> 00:00:59,728
Zeek hides the trap on the cutting board. Now they need bait.

14
00:00:59,828 --> 00:01:02,617
Old Hissy! Over here! Come and get us!

15
00:01:02,717 --> 00:01:05,649
NOISE! I'll boil you all into soup!

16
00:01:05,749 --> 00:01:09,860
Wait, why are my feet sticky? Why are my feet SO sticky?!

17
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:14,765
I'll save you, Bup! Hold on! Oh no. Oh no, no, no. I'm stuck too!

18
00:01:14,865 --> 00:01:19,382
Don't worry! I know how to switch it off. Step one, I walk over here...

19
00:01:19,482 --> 00:01:22,825
...and step two, I am now also stuck. Wonderful.

20
00:01:24,425 --> 00:01:28,794
Ha! Three sticky buns! Mr. Pot will be SO pleased with me.

21
00:01:28,894 --> 00:01:32,425
And now... a little steam. Just to keep you warm.

22
00:01:32,524 --> 00:01:35,378
Don't you dare! Those are my brothers!

23
00:01:35,478 --> 00:01:39,368
A tiny cookie? Go home, cookie. Ssssilence!

24
00:01:39,468 --> 00:01:43,405
Wait. He hates noise. And the steam makes the honey melt. Bup, look! It's melting!

25
00:01:43,505 --> 00:01:47,467
Pim, that's genius! The louder we are, the hotter he gets!

26
00:01:47,567 --> 00:01:50,590
New plan. Everybody... make... NOISE!

27
00:01:50,690 --> 00:01:53,601
AAAAAAH! AAAAAAH! I've been practicing this my whole life!

28
00:01:53,701 --> 00:01:57,322
La la la! Loud equations! Two plus two is FOUR!

29
00:01:57,422 --> 00:02:02,670
And I'll sing the loudest song in Table Land! LA LA LAAAA!

30
00:02:02,770 --> 00:02:07,211
Ssstop! Sssstop it! I'm boiling! I'm BOILING OVER!

31
00:02:08,711 --> 00:02:14,081
Steam pours over the trap. The honey melts... and the sticky heroes slide free.

32
00:02:14,181 --> 00:02:17,640
My water... it's all gone. I'm... so... empty.

33
00:02:17,739 --> 00:02:22,554
Fascinating. He boiled himself dry. My trap worked. Technically.

34
00:02:22,655 --> 00:02:26,991
Sorry, Mister Hissy. We'll be quiet now. Very quiet.

35
00:02:27,091 --> 00:02:31,340
Go... before Mr. Pot hears you. The tunnel... is behind me.

36
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:35,509
Bup holds up the Golden Crumb. The little door clicks open.

37
00:02:35,608 --> 00:02:37,821
Crispy, hold on. We're coming.

38
00:02:37,921 --> 00:02:41,725
It's dark. It's so dark. Why is the tunnel warm? Tunnels should NOT be warm!

39
00:02:41,825 --> 00:02:47,003
Because we are right under the oven. Eleven fifty-five. Five minutes left.

40
00:02:47,103 --> 00:02:50,617
Then, from deep in the tunnel, a voice calls out.

41
00:02:50,717 --> 00:02:55,077
Friends... is that you? Don't come any closer.

42
00:02:55,177 --> 00:02:58,563
Crispy! You're okay! We came to take you home!

43
00:02:58,663 --> 00:03:04,393
No. Listen. It's a trap. Mr. Pot is not alone anymore.

44
00:03:05,993 --> 00:03:09,094
Not alone? What does not alone mean? I don't like not alone!

45
00:03:09,194 --> 00:03:15,353
Behind them, in the dark, something goes click, click, click. And it smells like burning toast.
